# oracle: cut-down tableting (pair_style granular mdr, plastic, bulk response with psi_b 0.95): eight spheres of diameter 0.5 in a cylindrical die, a fixed lower punch and an upper punch moving down (fix wall/gran/region mdr); E 1000, nu 0.3, Y 5, surface energy 0.02, psi_b 0.95, eta_n0 0.5, damping mdr 1, tangential linear_history with rolling sds; fix nve/sphere, gravity off
# native: b332f28 (the installed lmp, GRANULAR included). Measured (engine vs native, black box; rel over |value| >= 1e-6; per-atom scale max(1,|value|)): thermo max rel 2.2e-13, per-atom max scaled 1.9e-14; engine 147 ms. The contacts yield (plastic branch) and the bulk response runs (psi_b 0.95: about 10500 contact-side steps; with psi_b 0.5 the bulk branch never ran). rolling sds is on for pairs and walls (its zero-cap reset was the step-by-step fix in src/engine/force/pair/granular.ts).
units           lj
atom_style      sphere 1
atom_modify     map array
comm_modify     vel yes
newton          off
boundary        f f f
region          box block -2 2 -2 2 -1 3 units box
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 single -0.225 -0.225 0.3
create_atoms    1 single 0.225 -0.225 0.3
create_atoms    1 single -0.225 0.225 0.3
create_atoms    1 single 0.225 0.225 0.3
create_atoms    1 single -0.225 -0.225 0.75
create_atoms    1 single 0.225 -0.225 0.75
create_atoms    1 single -0.225 0.225 0.75
create_atoms    1 single 0.225 0.225 0.75
set type 1 diameter 0.5 density 1.0
velocity        all set 0.0 0.0 0.0 units box
variable        disp equal 0.0
variable        dispupper equal -0.2*elapsed*dt
region          lower plane 0 0 0 0 0 1 side in units box
region          upper plane 0 0 1.05 0 0 -1 side in move NULL NULL v_dispupper units box
region          die cylinder z 0 0 1.0 0 1.6 side in units box
pair_style      granular
pair_coeff      * * mdr 1000.0 0.3 5.0 0.02 0.95 0.5 damping mdr 1 tangential linear_history 71.4285714285714 0.5 0.5 rolling sds 202.5 0.0 0.6
fix             lowerPunch all wall/gran/region granular mdr 1000.0 0.3 5.0 0.0 0.95 0.5 damping mdr 1 tangential linear_history 71.4285714285714 0.5 0.1 rolling sds 202.5 0.0 0.6 region lower
fix             upperPunch all wall/gran/region granular mdr 1000.0 0.3 5.0 0.0 0.95 0.5 damping mdr 1 tangential linear_history 71.4285714285714 0.5 0.1 rolling sds 202.5 0.0 0.6 region upper
fix             die all wall/gran/region granular mdr 1000.0 0.3 5.0 0.0 0.95 0.5 damping mdr 1 tangential linear_history 71.4285714285714 0.5 0.1 rolling sds 202.5 0.0 0.6 region die
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nve/sphere
thermo_style    custom step ke
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          200
run             1000
